  itemDescription: "Aging Research Institute  Consultation on CPEB4 Gene Restoration
    Technology Preventing Muscle Cell Aging  This institute is devoted to understanding
    the biology of aging and improving health span. It researches age-related diseases
    (like Alzheimer\u2019s, Parkinson\u2019s, and osteoporosis) and interventions
    to promote healthy aging. Focus areas include geriatric medicine, longevity therapeutics,
    regenerative medicine, and lifestyle factors affecting the elderly. The institute\u2019s
    goal is to develop strategies that help citizens live longer, healthier lives
    and reduce the burden of chronic age-related illnesses"
